window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n816\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγραφος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον. I. Não escrito, não registrado, de memórias, testamentos orais, herdeiros e discursos sem texto; Tucídides, Plutarco. II. Justiça equitativa não escrit</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n817\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγρει</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Imperativo ἄγρει: remissão ao segundo uso de ἀγρέω, «toma!, vamos!»; não constitui nova acepção autônoma.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n818\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρεῖος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -α, -ον. I. Campestre, rural, dos campos; de plátano, Antologia Palatina. II. Rústico no sentido pejorativo, rude, grosseiro; Aristófanes.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n819\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρειοσύνη</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: rusticidade, modos grosseiros ou vida errante sem refinamento; Antologia Palatina 6.51.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n820\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρεῖφνα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: grade agrícola, instrumento para gradear a terra; Antologia Palatina 6.297; cf. ἀγρίφη.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n821\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρέμιον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro: equivalente a ἄγρα no sentido da presa capturada; Antologia Palatina 6.224.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n822\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρεμών</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ονος. I. Caçador, Etymologicum Magnum. II. Em Hesíquio, glosado também por vara, tocha e lança. III. Possivelmente equivalente a ἐπι</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n823\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρεσία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, jônico -ιη: caçada, ato da caça, equivalente a ἄγρα no primeiro sentido; Antologia Palatina 6.13.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n824\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρεταί</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Feminino plural de ἀγρετός, «escolhidas»: sacerdotisas de Atena na ilha de Cós; inscrição do Museu Britânico e Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n825\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρετεύω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: ocupar o cargo de ἀγρέτας, sacerdote ou oficial assim designado; inscrição lacônica do século II d.C.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n826\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρετήματα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa lacônica ἀγρετήματα: palavras ou expressões ditas pelas donzelas; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n827\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρέτης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, dórico ἀγρέτας. I. Líder, condutor, equivalente a ἡγεμών; Hesíquio. II. Ἀγρέτης, possível epíteto de Apolo como deus dos campos em Quios; etim</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n828\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγρευμα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro. I. No plural, bens ou posses rurais, Sólon apud glossário. II. Presa caçada, caça capturada, inclusive figurada, Eurípides, Xenofonte. III. Meio </td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n829\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρεύς</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -έως. I. Caçador, epíteto de Aristeu, Apolo, Dioniso, Posêidon e Pã. II. De flecha, instrumento de caça. III. Espécie de ave; Eliano.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n830\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρεύσιμος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -η, -ον: fácil de capturar, que pode ser caçado; escólio a Sófocles, Filoctetes 863.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n831\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγρευσις</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, genitivo -εως: ato de capturar, caça, apreensão; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n832\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρευτεῖ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Glosa ἀγρευτεῖ = ὑβρίζει, «injuria, insulta, age insolentemente»; Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n833\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρευτήρ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῆρος: caçador, equivalente a ἀγρευτής; Teócrito, Calímaco. Como adjetivo, cães de caça ou rede de pesca, Opiano e Manílio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n834\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρευτής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino. I. Caçador, epíteto de Apolo por matar Píton; de sono como caçador de sonhos, metaforicamente. II. Adjetivo de cães caçadores e armadilhas de </td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n835\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρευτικός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ή, -όν: próprio da caça ou habilidoso em capturar; de rede e táticas militares, Xenofonte. Advérbio ἀγρευτικῶς; Pólux.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n836\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρευτίς</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: caçadora, forma feminina de ἀγρευτής; leitura provável em escólio a Aristófanes, Vespas.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n837\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρευτός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo verbal -όν: capturado, apanhado em caçada; Opiano, Haliêutica 3.541.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n838\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρεύω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: I. Capturar na caça ou na pesca, apanhar animais e pessoas, até em guerra; Heródoto, Xenofonte, Sófocles, Eurípides. Médio: capturar para si, arrebatando. Pas</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n839\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγρέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo. I. Apanhar, agarrar, tomar, capturar, inclusive cidade ou peixe; formas eólicas e poesia, Safo, Ésquilo. Imperativo ἄγρει, «toma!». II. Em Homero, sobretudo c</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n840\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγρηθεν</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Advérbio: proveniente da caça, de regresso da caçada; Apolônio de Rodes. Glosa ἀγρήθετο = ἠθέλησεν, «quis, desejou», Hesíquio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.cardsHtml+="<article id=\"entry-lsj-n816\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n816\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"826\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγραφος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον. I. Não escrito, não registrado, de memórias, testamentos orais, herdeiros e discursos sem texto; Tucídides, Plutarco. II. Just\">ἄγραφος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Adjetivo -ον. I. Não escrito, não registrado, de memórias, testamentos orais, herdeiros e discursos sem texto; Tucídides, Plutarco. II. Justiça equitativa não escrita, leis naturais, costumes e tradição religiosa, ἄγραφα νόμιμα; Demóstenes, Aristóteles, Lísias. III. Não inscrito em registros, de cidades, casamentos sem contrato, bens diversos não inventariados, minas clandestinas; papiros e inscrições. IV. Sem inscrição gravada. Advérbio ἀγράφως; sobretudo em prosa.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/grafos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n816&quot; key=&quot;a)/grafos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγραφ-ος&quot;&gt;ἄγραφος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n816.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;unwritten,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μνήμη&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:2:43&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 2.43&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. διαθῆκαι&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;nuncupatory&lt;/i&gt; wills, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,016:9&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cor.&lt;/title&gt; 9&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. κληρονόμος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,044:23&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tox.&lt;/title&gt; 23&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγραφα λέγειν&lt;/foreign&gt; to speak &lt;i&gt;without book,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,054:8&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Dem.&lt;/title&gt; 8&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-φως, κατὰ μνήμης σῴζεσθαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4036,008:p.553&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Procl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;in Prm.&lt;/title&gt; p.553&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; &lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n816.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. δίκαιον,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;moral&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;equitable justice,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,010:1162b:22&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;EN&lt;/title&gt; 1162b22&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. νόμοι&lt;/foreign&gt; or &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;νόμιμα&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;unwritten laws&lt;/i&gt;: &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;1&quot; id=&quot;n816.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;laws of nature,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τοῖς ἀ. νομίμοις καὶ τοῖς ἀνθρωπίνοις ἤθεσι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,018:275&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 18.275&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,010:1180b:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;EN&lt;/title&gt; 1180b1&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n816.3&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;laws of custom,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:2:37&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 2.37&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. νόμιμα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:793a&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 793a&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,038:1373b:5&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Rh.&lt;/title&gt; 1373b5&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;orth lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγραφα&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τά&lt;/gen&gt;, ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,038:1368b:9&quot;&gt;1368b9&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. ἀδίκημα&lt;/foreign&gt; a crime &lt;i&gt;not recognized by law,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n816.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;religious traditions,&lt;/i&gt; as of the Eumolpidae, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0540,006:10&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lys.&lt;/author&gt; 6.10&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n816.5&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;not registered,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. πόλεις&lt;/foreign&gt; (in a treaty) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:1:40&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 1.40&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. γάμοι&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;without written contract,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,CPR:18:30&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;CPR&lt;/title&gt; 18.30&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;date&gt;ii A.D.&lt;/date&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ως&lt;/foreign&gt; ibid., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Oxy.:267:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;POxy.&lt;/title&gt; 267.19&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(i A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;); &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. συνουσίαι&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;not written down,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4015,009:513:30&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Phlp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;in Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 513.30&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;συναλλαγματογραφίαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Tebt.:1:140&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PTeb.&lt;/title&gt; 1.140&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγραφα καὶ ἄστατα&lt;/foreign&gt; neither &lt;i&gt;catalogued&lt;/i&gt; nor weighed, &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 2.652&lt;hi rend=&quot;ital&quot;&gt;B&lt;/hi&gt;2; hence &lt;orth lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγραφα&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τά&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;i&gt;sundries,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;PTeb.&lt;/title&gt; 112.104 &lt;date&gt;(ii B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;, al. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n816.6&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. μέταλλα&lt;/foreign&gt; mines &lt;i&gt;not registered,&lt;/i&gt; but worked clandestinely, &lt;author&gt;Suid.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;abbr&gt;s.v.&lt;/abbr&gt; &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;IV&quot; id=&quot;n816.7&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;without inscription,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 2.754, al.—Prose word.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n817\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n817\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"827\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγρει\" data-meanings=\"Imperativo ἄγρει: remissão ao segundo uso de ἀγρέω, «toma!, vamos!»; não constitui nova acepção autônoma.\">ἄγρει</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Imperativo ἄγρει: remissão ao segundo uso de ἀγρέω, «toma!, vamos!»; não constitui nova acepção autônoma.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/grei&quot; orig_id=&quot;n817&quot; key=&quot;a)/grei&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγρει&quot;&gt;ἄγρει&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n817.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; sub ἀγρέω II.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n818\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n818\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"828\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρεῖος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -α, -ον. I. Campestre, rural, dos campos; de plátano, Antologia Palatina. II. Rústico no sentido pejorativo, rude, grosseiro; Arist\">ἀγρεῖος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Adjetivo -α, -ον. I. Campestre, rural, dos campos; de plátano, Antologia Palatina. II. Rústico no sentido pejorativo, rude, grosseiro; Aristófanes.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grei=os&quot; orig_id=&quot;n818&quot; key=&quot;a)grei=os&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρεῖος&quot;&gt;ἀγρεῖος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;α&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρός&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n818.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;of the field&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;country,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πλάτανος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:35&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.35&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Leon.&lt;/author&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n818.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;clownish, boorish,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,003:655&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Nu.&lt;/title&gt; 655&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,008:160&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Th.&lt;/title&gt; 160&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n819\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n819\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"829\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρειοσύνη\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: rusticidade, modos grosseiros ou vida errante sem refinamento; Antologia Palatina 6.51.\">ἀγρειοσύνη</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo feminino: rusticidade, modos grosseiros ou vida errante sem refinamento; Antologia Palatina 6.51.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greiosu/nh&quot; orig_id=&quot;n819&quot; key=&quot;a)greiosu/nh&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρειοσύνη&quot;&gt;ἀγρειοσύνη&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n819.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;clownishness&lt;/i&gt;: or &lt;i&gt;a rude, vagrant life,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:51&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.51&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n820\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n820\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"830\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρεῖφνα\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: grade agrícola, instrumento para gradear a terra; Antologia Palatina 6.297; cf. ἀγρίφη.\">ἀγρεῖφνα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo feminino: grade agrícola, instrumento para gradear a terra; Antologia Palatina 6.297; cf. ἀγρίφη.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)grei=fna&quot; orig_id=&quot;n820&quot; key=&quot;a)grei=fna&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρεῖφνα&quot;&gt;ἀγρεῖφνα&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n820.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;harrow,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:297&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.297&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Phanias&lt;/author&gt;); cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρίφη&lt;/foreign&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n821\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n821\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"831\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρέμιον\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro: equivalente a ἄγρα no sentido da presa capturada; Antologia Palatina 6.224.\">ἀγρέμιον</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo neutro: equivalente a ἄγρα no sentido da presa capturada; Antologia Palatina 6.224.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gre/mion&quot; orig_id=&quot;n821&quot; key=&quot;a)gre/mion&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρέμιον&quot;&gt;ἀγρέμιον&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n821.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἄγρα II, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:224&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.224&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Theodorid.&lt;/author&gt;).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n822\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n822\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"832\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρεμών\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ονος. I. Caçador, Etymologicum Magnum. II. Em Hesíquio, glosado também por vara, tocha e lança. III. Possiv\">ἀγρεμών</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ονος. I. Caçador, Etymologicum Magnum. II. Em Hesíquio, glosado também por vara, tocha e lança. III. Possivelmente equivalente a ἐπιμήνιος em fragmento de Ésquilo.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gremw/n&quot; orig_id=&quot;n822&quot; key=&quot;a)gremw/n&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρεμών&quot;&gt;ἀγρεμών&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όνος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n822.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;hunter,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;EM&lt;/title&gt; 13.56; also glossed by &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κάμαξ, λαμπάς, δόρν,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;: = ἐπιμήνιος, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,008:141&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 141&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n823\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n823\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"833\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρεσία\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, jônico -ιη: caçada, ato da caça, equivalente a ἄγρα no primeiro sentido; Antologia Palatina 6.13.\">ἀγρεσία</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo feminino, jônico -ιη: caçada, ato da caça, equivalente a ἄγρα no primeiro sentido; Antologia Palatina 6.13.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gresi/a&quot; orig_id=&quot;n823&quot; key=&quot;a)gresi/a&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρεσία&quot;&gt;ἀγρεσία&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ion.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-ιη,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n823.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἄγρα I, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:13&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.13&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Leon.&lt;/author&gt;).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n824\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n824\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"834\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρεταί\" data-meanings=\"Feminino plural de ἀγρετός, «escolhidas»: sacerdotisas de Atena na ilha de Cós; inscrição do Museu Britânico e Hesíquio.\">ἀγρεταί</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Feminino plural de ἀγρετός, «escolhidas»: sacerdotisas de Atena na ilha de Cós; inscrição do Museu Britânico e Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gretai/&quot; orig_id=&quot;n824&quot; key=&quot;a)gretai/&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρεταί&quot;&gt;ἀγρεταί&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;αἱ&lt;/gen&gt;, (fem. pl. of &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρετός&lt;/foreign&gt; ‘chosen’, cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρέω&lt;/foreign&gt;) priestesses of Athena at Cos, &lt;title&gt;BMus.Inscr.&lt;/title&gt; 968 &lt;title&gt;A&lt;/title&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n825\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n825\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"835\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρετεύω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: ocupar o cargo de ἀγρέτας, sacerdote ou oficial assim designado; inscrição lacônica do século II d.C.\">ἀγρετεύω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Verbo: ocupar o cargo de ἀγρέτας, sacerdote ou oficial assim designado; inscrição lacônica do século II d.C.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greteu/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n825&quot; key=&quot;a)greteu/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρετεύω&quot;&gt;ἀγρετεύω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n825.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;hold office of &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρέτας,&lt;/foreign&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 5(1).1346 (&lt;placeName&gt;Laconia&lt;/placeName&gt;, &lt;date&gt;ii A.D.&lt;/date&gt;).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n826\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n826\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"836\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρετήματα\" data-meanings=\"Glosa lacônica ἀγρετήματα: palavras ou expressões ditas pelas donzelas; Hesíquio.\">ἀγρετήματα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Glosa lacônica ἀγρετήματα: palavras ou expressões ditas pelas donzelas; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greth/mata&quot; orig_id=&quot;n826&quot; key=&quot;a)greth/mata&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρετήματα·&quot;&gt;ἀγρετήματα&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὰ ἀγορευόμενα τῶν παρθένων&lt;/foreign&gt; (&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Lacon.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;), &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n827\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n827\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"837\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρέτης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, dórico ἀγρέτας. I. Líder, condutor, equivalente a ἡγεμών; Hesíquio. II. Ἀγρέτης, possível epíteto de Apolo como deus \">ἀγρέτης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo masculino, dórico ἀγρέτας. I. Líder, condutor, equivalente a ἡγεμών; Hesíquio. II. Ἀγρέτης, possível epíteto de Apolo como deus dos campos em Quios; etimologia hipotética.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gre/ths&quot; orig_id=&quot;n827&quot; key=&quot;a)gre/ths&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρέτης&quot;&gt;ἀγρέτης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ου&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Dor.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρέτας&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n827.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἡγεμών, &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;; prob. for &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρόται,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,002:1002&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pers.&lt;/title&gt; 1002&lt;/bibl&gt; Toup. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n827.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ἀγρέτης&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, perh. from &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρός,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;god of the fields,&lt;/i&gt; title of Apollo at Chios, &lt;title&gt;GDI&lt;/title&gt; 5666.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n828\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n828\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"838\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγρευμα\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro. I. No plural, bens ou posses rurais, Sólon apud glossário. II. Presa caçada, caça capturada, inclusive figurada, Eurípid\">ἄγρευμα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo neutro. I. No plural, bens ou posses rurais, Sólon apud glossário. II. Presa caçada, caça capturada, inclusive figurada, Eurípides, Xenofonte. III. Meio de captura, armadilha, especialmente rede fatal sobre Agamêmnon, Ésquilo.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/greuma&quot; orig_id=&quot;n828&quot; key=&quot;a)/greuma&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγρ-ευμα&quot;&gt;ἄγρευμα&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, in pl., &lt;sense id=&quot;n828.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= τὰ ἐπὶ τῆς ἀγροικίας κτήματα, &lt;author&gt;Sol.&lt;/author&gt; ap. &lt;title&gt;AB&lt;/title&gt; 340. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n828.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;that which is taken in hunting, prey,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:1241&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 1241&lt;/bibl&gt;: metaph., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,002:3:11:7&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mem.&lt;/title&gt; 3.11.7&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. ἀνθέων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,020:754&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 754&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n828.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;means of catching,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. θηρός&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,006:998&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ch.&lt;/title&gt; 998&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐντὸς . . μορσίμων ἀ.,&lt;/foreign&gt; of the &lt;i&gt;net&lt;/i&gt; thrown over Agamemnon, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:1048&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 1048&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,007:460&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Eu.&lt;/title&gt; 460&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n829\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n829\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"839\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρεύς\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, genitivo -έως. I. Caçador, epíteto de Aristeu, Apolo, Dioniso, Posêidon e Pã. II. De flecha, instrumento de caça. III\">ἀγρεύς</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -έως. I. Caçador, epíteto de Aristeu, Apolo, Dioniso, Posêidon e Pã. II. De flecha, instrumento de caça. III. Espécie de ave; Eliano. Relação primordial com ἀγρός, a caça sendo secundária.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greu/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n829&quot; key=&quot;a)greu/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-εύς&quot;&gt;ἀγρεύς&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;έως&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n829.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;hunter,&lt;/i&gt; epith. of Aristaeus, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:9:65&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 9.65&lt;/bibl&gt;; of Apollo, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,008:200&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 200&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0650,001:3:34&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Herod.&lt;/author&gt; 3.34&lt;/bibl&gt;; of Bacchus, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:1192&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 1192&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.); of Poseidon, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,025:47&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pisc.&lt;/title&gt; 47&lt;/bibl&gt;; of Pan, &lt;author&gt;Apollod.&lt;/author&gt; ap. &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n829.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of an arrow, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:75&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.75&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Paul.Sil.&lt;/author&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n829.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; a kind of bird, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0545,001:8:24&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ael.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;NA&lt;/title&gt; 8.24&lt;/bibl&gt;. (From &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρός,&lt;/foreign&gt; cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἰκεύς&lt;/foreign&gt; : &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οἶκος&lt;/foreign&gt;; the reference to hunting is secondary.)&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n830\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n830\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"840\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρεύσιμος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -η, -ον: fácil de capturar, que pode ser caçado; escólio a Sófocles, Filoctetes 863.\">ἀγρεύσιμος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Adjetivo -η, -ον: fácil de capturar, que pode ser caçado; escólio a Sófocles, Filoctetes 863.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greu/simos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n830&quot; key=&quot;a)greu/simos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-εύσιμος&quot;&gt;ἀγρεύσιμος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;η&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n830.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;easy to catch,&lt;/i&gt; Sch. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,006:863&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 863&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n831\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n831\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"841\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγρευσις\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, genitivo -εως: ato de capturar, caça, apreensão; Hesíquio.\">ἄγρευσις</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo feminino, genitivo -εως: ato de capturar, caça, apreensão; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/greusis&quot; orig_id=&quot;n831&quot; key=&quot;a)/greusis&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγρ-ευσις&quot;&gt;ἄγρευσις&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;εως&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n831.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;catching,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n832\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n832\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"842\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρευτεῖ\" data-meanings=\"Glosa ἀγρευτεῖ = ὑβρίζει, «injuria, insulta, age insolentemente»; Hesíquio.\">ἀγρευτεῖ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Glosa ἀγρευτεῖ = ὑβρίζει, «injuria, insulta, age insolentemente»; Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greutei=&quot; orig_id=&quot;n832&quot; key=&quot;a)greutei=&quot; type=&quot;gloss&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ευτεῖ·&quot;&gt;ἀγρευτεῖ&lt;/head&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὑβρίζει,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n833\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n833\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"843\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρευτήρ\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῆρος: caçador, equivalente a ἀγρευτής; Teócrito, Calímaco. Como adjetivo, cães de caça ou rede de pesca, Op\">ἀγρευτήρ</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo masculino, genitivo -ῆρος: caçador, equivalente a ἀγρευτής; Teócrito, Calímaco. Como adjetivo, cães de caça ou rede de pesca, Opiano e Manílio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greuth/r&quot; orig_id=&quot;n833&quot; key=&quot;a)greuth/r&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ευτήρ&quot;&gt;ἀγρευτήρ&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ῆρος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;833.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= sq., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0005,001:21:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Theoc.&lt;/author&gt; 21.6&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0533,017:218&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Call.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Dian.&lt;/title&gt; 218&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:7:578&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 7.578&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Agath.&lt;/author&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n833.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; as &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adj.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. κύνες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0024,001:3:456&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Opp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;C.&lt;/title&gt; 3.456&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρευτῆρι λίνῳ,&lt;/foreign&gt; i.e. with &lt;i&gt;fishing&lt;/i&gt;-net, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2583,001:5:279&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Man.&lt;/author&gt; 5.279&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n834\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n834\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"844\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρευτής\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino. I. Caçador, epíteto de Apolo por matar Píton; de sono como caçador de sonhos, metaforicamente. II. Adjetivo de cães c\">ἀγρευτής</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo masculino. I. Caçador, epíteto de Apolo por matar Píton; de sono como caçador de sonhos, metaforicamente. II. Adjetivo de cães caçadores e armadilhas de junco para aves; Sólon e Antologia Palatina.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greuth/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n834&quot; key=&quot;a)greuth/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ευτής&quot;&gt;ἀγρευτής&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;οῦ&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n834.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;hunter,&lt;/i&gt; epith. of Apollo as slayer of &lt;author&gt;Python&lt;/author&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,007:1091&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OC&lt;/title&gt; 1091&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Flor.:297:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PFlor.&lt;/title&gt; 297.19&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(vi A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;: metaph., of sleep, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. πτηνοῦ φάσματος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:12:125&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 12.125&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Mel.&lt;/author&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n834.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adj.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κύνες ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;hounds,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0263,001:23&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Sol.&lt;/author&gt; 23&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. κάλαμοι&lt;/foreign&gt; a fowlerʼs &lt;i&gt;trap of reeds,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:7:171&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 7.171&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Mnasalc.&lt;/author&gt;), cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1513,001:6:109&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;6.109&lt;/bibl&gt; (Antip.).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n835\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n835\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"845\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρευτικός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ή, -όν: próprio da caça ou habilidoso em capturar; de rede e táticas militares, Xenofonte. Advérbio ἀγρευτικῶς; Pólux.\">ἀγρευτικός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Adjetivo -ή, -όν: próprio da caça ou habilidoso em capturar; de rede e táticas militares, Xenofonte. Advérbio ἀγρευτικῶς; Pólux.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greutiko/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n835&quot; key=&quot;a)greutiko/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ευτικός&quot;&gt;ἀγρευτικός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ή&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n835.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;of&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;skilled in hunting,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρευτικόν [ἐστι]&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;useful for ensnaring&lt;/i&gt; an enemy, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,012:4:12&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Eq.Mag.&lt;/title&gt; 4.12&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. λίνος&lt;/foreign&gt; Sch. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:611&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 611&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;-κῶς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0542,001:5:9&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Poll.&lt;/author&gt; 5.9&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n836\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n836\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"846\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρευτίς\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: caçadora, forma feminina de ἀγρευτής; leitura provável em escólio a Aristófanes, Vespas.\">ἀγρευτίς</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Substantivo feminino: caçadora, forma feminina de ἀγρευτής; leitura provável em escólio a Aristófanes, Vespas.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greuti/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n836&quot; key=&quot;a)greuti/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ευτίς&quot;&gt;ἀγρευτίς&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ίδος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, fem. of &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρευτής,&lt;/foreign&gt; prob. l. in Sch. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,004:367&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;V.&lt;/title&gt; 367&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n837\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n837\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"847\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρευτός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo verbal -όν: capturado, apanhado em caçada; Opiano, Haliêutica 3.541.\">ἀγρευτός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Adjetivo verbal -όν: capturado, apanhado em caçada; Opiano, Haliêutica 3.541.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greuto/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n837&quot; key=&quot;a)greuto/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-ευτός&quot;&gt;ἀγρευτός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n837.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;caught,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0023,001:3:541&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Opp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;H.&lt;/title&gt; 3.541&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n838\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n838\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"848\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρεύω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: I. Capturar na caça ou na pesca, apanhar animais e pessoas, até em guerra; Heródoto, Xenofonte, Sófocles, Eurípides. Médio: capturar \">ἀγρεύω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Verbo: I. Capturar na caça ou na pesca, apanhar animais e pessoas, até em guerra; Heródoto, Xenofonte, Sófocles, Eurípides. Médio: capturar para si, arrebatando. Passivo: ser capturado. II. Figuradamente, perseguir sangue, virtude ou sono; tentar surpreender alguém pelas palavras, Marcos 12.13. Formas futuro ἀγρεύσω, aoristo ἤγρευσα.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)greu/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n838&quot; key=&quot;a)greu/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρ-εύω&quot;&gt;ἀγρεύω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;fut.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;εύσω&lt;/itype&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0533,017:85&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Call.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Dian.&lt;/title&gt; 85&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἤγρευσα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:1204&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 1204&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:— &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Med.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; infr.:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠγρεύθην&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt;, &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; infr.: (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρεύς&lt;/etym&gt;):—&lt;sense id=&quot;n838.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;take by hunting&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;fishing, catch,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἰχθῦς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:2:95&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 2.95&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,014:12:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyn.&lt;/title&gt; 12.6&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγραν ἠγρευκότες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:434&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 434&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; of war, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;φιλεῖ . . ἄνδρας . . ἀγρεύειν νέους&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,008:554&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 554&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:—also in &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Med.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;θύματʼ ἠγρεύσασθε&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;ye caught&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;chose your&lt;/i&gt; victim, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,013:1163&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;IT&lt;/title&gt; 1163&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τί μοι ξίφος ἐκ χερὸς ἠγρεύσω&lt;/foreign&gt;; why &lt;i&gt;didst thou snatch . . ?&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,006:842&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Andr.&lt;/title&gt; 842&lt;/bibl&gt;:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,006:5:3:8&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;An.&lt;/title&gt; 5.3.8&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1693,001:1:142&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Sphaer.Stoic.&lt;/author&gt; 1.142&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρευθεὶς ἤγρευσε&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:9:94&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 9.94&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Isid.&lt;/author&gt;), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4052,001:12:113&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;12.113&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Mel.&lt;/author&gt;). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n838.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; metaph., &lt;i&gt;hunt after, thirst for,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;αἷμα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,017:138&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ba.&lt;/title&gt; 138&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;σὰν&lt;/foreign&gt; (sc. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Ἀρετᾶς&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt; ἀ. δύναμιν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,051:675:11&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 675.11&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὕπνον&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:7:196&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 7.196&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Mel.&lt;/author&gt;), cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1492,001:12:125&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;12.125&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Mel.&lt;/author&gt;); but &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρεύειν τινὰ λόγῳ&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;to catch&lt;/i&gt; by his words, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,002:12:13&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ev.Marc.&lt;/title&gt; 12.13&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n839\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n839\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"849\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγρέω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo. I. Apanhar, agarrar, tomar, capturar, inclusive cidade ou peixe; formas eólicas e poesia, Safo, Ésquilo. Imperativo ἄγρει, «toma!». I\">ἀγρέω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Verbo. I. Apanhar, agarrar, tomar, capturar, inclusive cidade ou peixe; formas eólicas e poesia, Safo, Ésquilo. Imperativo ἄγρει, «toma!». II. Em Homero, sobretudo como exortação ἄγρει/ἀγρεῖτε, «vamos!, anda!, vinde!», Ilíada e Odisseia.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gre/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n839&quot; key=&quot;a)gre/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγρέω&quot;&gt;ἀγρέω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n839.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= αἱρέω, &lt;i&gt;take, seize,&lt;/i&gt; freq. in Aeolic Inscrr. as &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 12(2).6.33 (&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, Lesbos); &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγρει δʼ οἶνον ἐρυθρόν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0232,001:4:3&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Archil.&lt;/author&gt; 4.3&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τρόμος παῖσαν ἄγρει&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Sapph.&lt;/author&gt; 2.14&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0002,001:294&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Thgn.&lt;/author&gt; 294&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρεῖ πόλιν&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;captures,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:126&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 126&lt;/bibl&gt; (lyr.); of fishing, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:6:304&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;AP&lt;/title&gt; 6.304&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;author&gt;Phanias&lt;/author&gt;); in prescriptions, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγρει,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;take!&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0022,001:534&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Nic.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Th.&lt;/title&gt; 534&lt;/bibl&gt;, al. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n839.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt; only in imper. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγρει,&lt;/foreign&gt; prop. &lt;i&gt;take it!,&lt;/i&gt; hence, &lt;i&gt;come on!&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγρει μάν οἱ ἔπορσον Ἀθηναίην&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:5:765&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 5.765&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0001,001:1:487&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.R.&lt;/author&gt; 1.487&lt;/bibl&gt;; pl., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγρεῖτε &lt;/foreign&gt; (&lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγρειτε&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;An.Ox.&lt;/title&gt; 1.71&lt;/cit&gt;) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:20:149&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 20.149&lt;/bibl&gt;. Cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄργειτε&lt;/foreign&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article><article id=\"entry-lsj-n840\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n840\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"850\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγρηθεν\" data-meanings=\"Advérbio: proveniente da caça, de regresso da caçada; Apolônio de Rodes. Glosa ἀγρήθετο = ἠθέλησεν, «quis, desejou», Hesíquio.\">ἄγρηθεν</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p>Advérbio: proveniente da caça, de regresso da caçada; Apolônio de Rodes. Glosa ἀγρήθετο = ἠθέλησεν, «quis, desejou», Hesíquio.</p></section><details><summary>Fonte TEI integral</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/grhqen&quot; orig_id=&quot;n840&quot; key=&quot;a)/grhqen&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγρηθεν&quot;&gt;ἄγρηθεν&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;sense id=&quot;n840.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;from the chase,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0001,001:2:938&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.R.&lt;/author&gt; 2.938&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;orth extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἀγρήθετο·&lt;/orth&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἠθέλησεν,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hsch.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>";
